  "body": "## 更新内容 / What's New（安卓 v0.1.25）\n\n这一版可以按星期给单个 App 设每日时长。\n\n**按星期设每日时长**\n- 在单个 App 的限制页里点「按星期设置」，周一到周日可以各设一个时长。某一天可以选「不限」，也可以设 0 分钟，那一天整天打不开。\n- 「快捷设置」可以一次改好工作日或周末：工作日是周一到周五一起改，周末是周六周日一起改。\n- 拦截页、提前倒计时和今日用量都按当天的时长来算。限制页会显示今天是多少分钟。\n- 改动里只要有一天放宽了，就和原来一样，要先等一会儿或者输解锁码，整次改动一起生效。收紧的改动保存后立刻生效。\n- 以前设的每日时长，升级后还是每天一样，不用重新设。\n- 打开次数的规则没有变。\n\n**已知限制**\n- 按星期设置的页面还没有在真机上看过，只在单元测试里验证过。\n- 跨到新的一天（比如周日到周一的零点）切换成新时长，还没有在真机上验证过。\n- iPhone 版没有同步这个功能，仍是 v0.1.5。\n\nversionCode: 48\nsha256: 0d44f3524d74c5ddc7fc879176b8111b0975cb844e2e7da1660c24de5cb1cdae\n\n---\n\nThis release lets you set a different daily limit for each day of the week for a single app.\n\n**Daily limits by weekday**\n- On an app's limit page, tap \"By weekday\" to set a limit for each day from Monday to Sunday. A day can be \"No limit\", or 0 min to block the app all day.\n- \"Quick set\" changes weekdays (Mon to Fri) or weekends (Sat and Sun) together.\n- The block screen, the countdown before a limit and today's usage all follow that day's limit. The limit page shows today's minutes.\n- If any day in a change is looser than before, the whole change waits or needs the unlock code, as before. Stricter changes take effect as soon as you save.\n- A daily limit you set before stays the same for every day after the update.\n- Open limits are unchanged.\n\n**Known limits**\n- The weekday settings page has not been checked on a real phone yet. It was verified in unit tests only.\n- Switching to the new day's limit at midnight (for example from Sunday to Monday) has not been verified on a real phone.\n- The iPhone app does not have this yet and remains v0.1.5.\n\nversionCode: 48\nsha256: 0d44f3524d74c5ddc7fc879176b8111b0975cb844e2e7da1660c24de5cb1cdae\n",
